  "reason": "Existing evidence is sparse, so this experiment tests the foundational multimodal approach (combining RNA and image data) with simple encoders (pca_n2000 and resnet50) and concat fusion. It clarifies whether multimodal integration provides value compared to single-modality baselines, isolating the effect of fusion strategy and encoder choices. This is the best use of the first experiment to establish directionality in the search."
